{
    "title": "Solitaire Collection",
    "description": "<b>Solitaire Collection</b> is a collection of classic solitaire card games with <b>Classic Solitaire</b> (known as <b>Klondike Solitaire</b> or <b>Patience Solitaire</b>), <b>Spider solitaire</b>, <b>FreeCell solitaire</b>, <b>TriPeaks Solitaire</b>, and <b>Pyramid solitaire</b> all in one game. Solitaire Collection is popular solitaire game in the world. If you like playing classic solitaire card games, this solitaire collection is the best choice for you. Just download once, and then play all the classic solitaire games you like. And also, you can play solitaire card games to build gardens. This solitaire collection will bring you much fun and keep your mind shard! \r\n\r\n<b>Classic Solitaire</b>, <b>Klondike Solitaire</b>, <b>Patience</b>\r\nSolitaire Collection has Klondike solitaire (also known as patience) in it. Klondike solitaire is the most classic solitaire card games in the world. Many people play Klondike solitaire card games to relax every day. The goal of the game is to move all the cards to the foundation from Aces to Kings in the same suit.\r\n\r\n<b>Spider Solitaire</b>\r\nSpider Solitaire is another classic solitaire card game. There are eight columns of cards on the table of spider solitaire. When you order Aces to Kings from the bottom to the top, these cards will be collected to the left top corner of the table. When all the cards in spider solitaire are collected, you win this game.\r\n\r\n<b>FreeCell Solitaire</b>\r\nFreeCell Solitaire is the most challenging and strategic of all solitaire card games. Taking advantage of the four free cell spaces to move and transfer cards is the key to clear all cards from the table.\r\n\r\n<b>TriPeaks Solitaire</b>\r\nTriPeaks Solitaire (also known as Tri Towers, Triple Peaks or Three Peaks) is a fun solitaire card game that combines elements from Golf Solitaire and Black Hole Solitaire. Play TriPeaks Solitaire to have a fun day!\r\n\r\n<b>Pyramid Solitaire</b>\r\nPyramid is a patience or solitaire game of the Simple Addition family. The goal of the game is to pair all uncovered cards whose total values equal 13. After all pairs are found out, you win the game.\r\n\r\n<b>Daily Challenges</b>\r\nDaily Challenges for each solitaire card games are waiting for you. Daily Challenges are more challenging and complex. Each kind of solitaire card games has three challenges.\r\n\r\n<b>Themes</b> & <b>Card Backs</b> & <b>Card Faces</b>\r\nBeautiful Themes: Hundreds of backgrounds, like Solitaire Butterfly, Solitaire Horse, Solitaire Waterfall, Solitaire Ocean fish, Solitaire Koi fish, Solitaire Moon, Solitaire Aquarium, Solitaire Kitten, Solitaire Snow, and so on.\r\nCard Faces & Card Backs: Hundreds beautiful card faces and card backs make each deal of your solitaire card games colorful.\r\n\r\n<b>Build Garden</b>\r\nPlaying solitaire card games can unlock the shabby or old gardens. You can repair and build the gardens, and then plant beautiful flowers in your gardens.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Solitaire Collection</b> is a collection of classic solitaire card games with <b>Classic Solitaire</b> (known as <b>Klondike Solitaire</b> or <b>Patience Solitaire</b>), <b>Spider solitaire</b>, <b>FreeCell solitaire</b>, <b>TriPeaks Solitaire</b>, and <b>Pyramid solitaire</b> all in one game. Solitaire Collection is popular solitaire game in the world. If you like playing classic solitaire card games, this solitaire collection is the best choice for you. Just download once, and then play all the classic solitaire games you like. And also, you can play solitaire card games to build gardens. This solitaire collection will bring you much fun and keep your mind shard! <br><br><b>Classic Solitaire</b>, <b>Klondike Solitaire</b>, <b>Patience</b><br>Solitaire Collection has Klondike solitaire (also known as patience) in it. Klondike solitaire is the most classic solitaire card games in the world. Many people play Klondike solitaire card games to relax every day. The goal of the game is to move all the cards to the foundation from Aces to Kings in the same suit.<br><br><b>Spider Solitaire</b><br>Spider Solitaire is another classic solitaire card game. There are eight columns of cards on the table of spider solitaire. When you order Aces to Kings from the bottom to the top, these cards will be collected to the left top corner of the table. When all the cards in spider solitaire are collected, you win this game.<br><br><b>FreeCell Solitaire</b><br>FreeCell Solitaire is the most challenging and strategic of all solitaire card games. Taking advantage of the four free cell spaces to move and transfer cards is the key to clear all cards from the table.<br><br><b>TriPeaks Solitaire</b><br>TriPeaks Solitaire (also known as Tri Towers, Triple Peaks or Three Peaks) is a fun solitaire card game that combines elements from Golf Solitaire and Black Hole Solitaire. Play TriPeaks Solitaire to have a fun day!<br><br><b>Pyramid Solitaire</b><br>Pyramid is a patience or solitaire game of the Simple Addition family. The goal of the game is to pair all uncovered cards whose total values equal 13. After all pairs are found out, you win the game.<br><br><b>Daily Challenges</b><br>Daily Challenges for each solitaire card games are waiting for you. Daily Challenges are more challenging and complex. Each kind of solitaire card games has three challenges.<br><br><b>Themes</b> &amp; <b>Card Backs</b> &amp; <b>Card Faces</b><br>Beautiful Themes: Hundreds of backgrounds, like Solitaire Butterfly, Solitaire Horse, Solitaire Waterfall, Solitaire Ocean fish, Solitaire Koi fish, Solitaire Moon, Solitaire Aquarium, Solitaire Kitten, Solitaire Snow, and so on.<br>Card Faces &amp; Card Backs: Hundreds beautiful card faces and card backs make each deal of your solitaire card games colorful.<br><br><b>Build Garden</b><br>Playing solitaire card games can unlock the shabby or old gardens. You can repair and build the gardens, and then plant beautiful flowers in your gardens.",
